    {
      "id": "tool-multi-chain",
      "name": "Agent chains several tools in one turn",
      "category": "tool-use",
      "description": "A single user request drives the agent through a sequence of auto-trusted tools \u2014 read a file, search the code, glob for files, list a directory \u2014 each rendering its own card before the agent synthesizes one answer, the way a user normally watches an agent work through a task",
